#!/usr/bin/env python3
# vmadmin - admin UI of the sandbox-worker VM on port 80 (host access only; NAT without DNAT)
# style like the relay admin UI (relay/templates/admin.html): dark theme, login card with
# sessionStorage, hash navigation, native <dialog> modals, CSP nonce, 401 without challenge
# (round 14: basic challenges trigger native browser login dialogs).
# Python stdlib only (http.server), no packages - provisioned via cloud-init.
# sources: AmbientCapabilities=CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE (systemd.exec, port < 1024 without root),
# ttyd default port 7681, no -c credential (ttyd sends no X-Frame-Options/frame-ancestors,
# so it can be iframed; vmadmin CSP allows frame-src http://<host>:7681),
# Python http.server (BaseHTTPRequestHandler/ThreadingHTTPServer).
